# Example ReRDMFT input file: CASSCF on stretched LiH (5 A) starting from the core-Hamiltonian orbitals (CASSCF_INIT CORE).
# The RHF of a stretched molecule is a poor (or non-converging) starting point; the one-electron-Hamiltonian eigenvectors are
# a clean alternative (the SCF still runs and reports its energy). CASSCF_INIT CORE needs the closed-shell CI start
# (CASSCF_CI_START SYMMETRIC, the default).
NELEC 4
BASIS lih-6-31g.gbs
NON_RELATIVISTIC TRUE
X2C TRUE
DIIS FALSE
CASSCF TRUE
CASSCF_ELECTRONS 2
CASSCF_SPINORS 4
CASSCF_INIT CORE

GEOMETRY
Li  0.000000   0.000000   0.000000
H   0.000000   0.000000   5.000000
END
